{"seq":1,"slug":"scalp-hype-intercept","title":"抢购/囤积炒作识别防控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/mystery-box-probability-commerce/secondary-market-guard/scalp-hype-intercept","wordCount":2021,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"抢购-囤积炒作识别防控\">抢购/囤积炒作识别防控</h1><p>概率商品有一种特殊的抢购动机：买到的不是商品本身，而是&quot;能抽到稀有款的入场券&quot;。这使抢购行为与普通秒杀有本质区别——普通秒杀抢的是确定的商品，盲盒抢购抢的是一组按概率分布的期望值，而其中一小部分人抢的是那个极低概率的高回报。结果是抢购者里混着三类完全不同的人：自用消费者、职业黄牛、以及赌高价值的投机者。防控的目标不是禁止抢购，而是让这三类人的行为成本与他们的经济动机相匹配。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三类抢购者与他们的信号\">核心概念：三类抢购者与他们的信号</h2><p>把抢购流量按动机分类，是设计一切防控手段的前提。三类动机对应三组特征信号，误判任一类的代价都不同。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>动机</th>\n<th>主要信号</th>\n<th>误判代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>自用消费者</td>\n<td>想要商品</td>\n<td>单账号、低频、地址稳定</td>\n<td>高（体验受损）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>职业黄牛</td>\n<td>转售套利</td>\n<td>多账号、集中地址、秒级下单</td>\n<td>中（漏放）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>投机者</td>\n<td>赌高价值款</td>\n<td>大额、集中系列、高抽次</td>\n<td>中（继续投入）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[下单流量] --&gt; B[身份与设备聚合]&#10;  B --&gt; C{账号簇密度}&#10;  C --&gt;|高| D[疑似黄牛簇]&#10;  C --&gt;|低| E[独立账号]&#10;  E --&gt; F{行为特征}&#10;  F --&gt;|秒级重复| G[自动化脚本嫌疑]&#10;  F --&gt;|正常节奏| H[自用]&#10;  F --&gt;|大额集中系列| I[投机嫌疑]&#10;  D --&gt; J[风控动作]&#10;  G --&gt; J&#10;  I --&gt; J&#10;  J --&gt; K[限流/验证码/降权/拒绝]\">graph TD\n  A[下单流量] --&gt; B[身份与设备聚合]\n  B --&gt; C{账号簇密度}\n  C --&gt;|高| D[疑似黄牛簇]\n  C --&gt;|低| E[独立账号]\n  E --&gt; F{行为特征}\n  F --&gt;|秒级重复| G[自动化脚本嫌疑]\n  F --&gt;|正常节奏| H[自用]\n  F --&gt;|大额集中系列| I[投机嫌疑]\n  D --&gt; J[风控动作]\n  G --&gt; J\n  I --&gt; J\n  J --&gt; K[限流/验证码/降权/拒绝]</pre><p>图上最关键的分岔是&quot;账号簇密度&quot;。黄牛的识别几乎总是从<strong>多个账号指向同一实体</strong>开始的——同一收货地址、同一支付工具、同一设备指纹、同一网络出口。单个账号的行为再异常也可能有正当解释，而一个簇的存在几乎没有正当解释。这一思路与对抗女巫攻击（Sybil attack）的经典防御同源：当一个系统按身份分配权益时，攻击者的首要动作就是制造大量伪造身份，因此防御的核心是建立身份与实体之间的一对一关系，或让身份获取具有真实成本（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sybil_attack\">Sybil attack</a>）。盲盒抢购的资源不是投票权而是限量的库存，但攻击形态与防御逻辑完全相同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"身份聚合-把账号还原成实体\">身份聚合：把账号还原成实体</h2><p>反黄牛的第一个技术动作是把散落的账号还原成背后的实际控制者。这个还原过程必须遵循隐私最小化——只用于风控决策，不做用途外的留存。</p>\n<h3 id=\"聚合维度的选择与强度\">聚合维度的选择与强度</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>强度</th>\n<th>可伪造性</th>\n<th>合规敏感度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>收货地址+收件人</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>支付工具标识</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>设备指纹</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络出口/IP</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行为序列相似度</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>推荐组合是&quot;地址+支付工具&quot;作为主判据、&quot;设备指纹&quot;作为辅证。理由是地址与支付工具都指向真实的经济行为，伪造成本高；而设备指纹与 IP 在共享设备、公共网络、动态出口环境下会产生大量假阳性。</p>\n<h3 id=\"簇识别的实现\">簇识别的实现</h3><p>簇识别不需要复杂算法，用连通分量即可：把每个账号视为节点，命中的聚合维度视为边，同一连通分量内的账号即为一个簇。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 命中的高风险维度建边&#10;CREATE TABLE account_edge (&#10;  a TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  b TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  dimension TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (dimension IN (&#39;address&#39;,&#39;payer&#39;,&#39;device&#39;)),&#10;  weight NUMERIC NOT NULL,&#10;  observed_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (a, b, dimension)&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 簇规模：按连通分量统计（需在应用侧做 union-find 或使用递归 CTE）&#10;SELECT root, COUNT(*) AS cluster_size&#10;FROM account_cluster&#10;GROUP BY root&#10;HAVING COUNT(*) &gt;= 5;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 命中的高风险维度建边</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> account_edge</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  dimension </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (dimension </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'address'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'payer'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'device'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  weight</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  observed_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (a, b, dimension)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 簇规模：按连通分量统计（需在应用侧做 union-find 或使用递归 CTE）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> root</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cluster_size</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> account_cluster</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> root</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">HAVING</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这里有一个必须明确的判断：<strong>簇规模本身不是封禁依据</strong>。一个五口之家共用收货地址与支付工具是合法的；一个宿舍楼共用 IP 也是合法的。簇必须与<strong>行为</strong>组合才构成证据——簇内账号同时对同一限量系列秒级下单，才是黄牛特征。</p>\n<h2 id=\"抢购节奏与自动化识别\">抢购节奏与自动化识别</h2><p>黄牛与自动化的关系密不可分：手工操作无法在秒级完成多账号下单，所以自动化脚本几乎是多账号抢购的必要条件。</p>\n<h3 id=\"秒级漏斗与人工边界的识别\">秒级漏斗与人工边界的识别</h3><p>识别自动化的核心指标是<strong>人类不可能完成的操作时序</strong>。合法用户从进入商品页到提交订单有阅读、选择、确认的过程，自动化则呈现极短的固定间隔。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import statistics&#10;&#10;def automation_signal(events, min_human_ms=800):&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;events: 同一账号的 (action, ts_ms) 序列。返回判定与依据。&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    gaps = [b.ts_ms - a.ts_ms for a, b in zip(events, events[1:])]&#10;    if not gaps:&#10;        return {&quot;auto&quot;: False, &quot;reason&quot;: &quot;single_event&quot;}&#10;    fast = [g for g in gaps if g &lt; min_human_ms]&#10;    if len(fast) &gt;= 3:&#10;        return {&quot;auto&quot;: True, &quot;reason&quot;: &quot;too_fast&quot;, &quot;fast_count&quot;: len(fast)}&#10;    try:&#10;        cv = statistics.pstdev(gaps) / max(statistics.mean(gaps), 1)&#10;    except statistics.StatisticsError:&#10;        cv = 0.0&#10;    if cv &lt; 0.05 and len(gaps) &gt;= 5:&#10;        return {&quot;auto&quot;: True, &quot;reason&quot;: &quot;too_regular&quot;, &quot;cv&quot;: round(cv, 4)}&#10;    return {&quot;auto&quot;: False, &quot;reason&quot;: &quot;human_like&quot;, &quot;cv&quot;: round(cv, 4)}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> statistics</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> automation_signal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(events, min_human_ms</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">800</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"events: 同一账号的 (action, ts_ms) 序列。返回判定与依据。\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    gaps </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [b.ts_ms </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a.ts_ms </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a, b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> zip</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(events, events[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:])]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gaps:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"auto\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">False</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"reason\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"single_event\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    fast </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [g </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> g </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gaps </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> g </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> min_human_ms]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(fast) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"auto\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"reason\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"too_fast\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"fast_count\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(fast)}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        cv </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> statistics.pstdev(gaps) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(statistics.mean(gaps), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    except</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> statistics.StatisticsError:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        cv </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cv </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.05</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> and</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(gaps) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"auto\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"reason\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"too_regular\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cv\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cv, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"auto\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">False</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"reason\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"human_like\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cv\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cv, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>两个判据各有侧重：<code>too_fast</code> 抓的是机器速度，<code>too_regular</code> 抓的是机器节奏——人类操作的间隔必然有波动，变异系数长期低于 0.05 几乎只可能来自定时循环。</p>\n<h3 id=\"风控动作的分级\">风控动作的分级</h3><p>识别出嫌疑之后，动作必须分级，因为误判代价不对称。自用消费者被误拦的代价（投诉、流失、声誉）高于黄牛漏放的代价。推荐四级动作：<strong>观察</strong>（仅记录）、<strong>加验</strong>（追加验证码或短信验证）、<strong>限流</strong>（限制该账号的并发与频率）、<strong>拒绝</strong>（拒绝下单）。默认从观察起步，只有簇+行为双重命中的账号才直接进入限流或拒绝。</p>\n<h2 id=\"囤积-库存侧的异常消耗\">囤积：库存侧的异常消耗</h2><p>抢购是瞬间行为，囤积是持续行为。囤积表现为某个账号或簇在短期内大量消耗某一层的库存，特别是高价值层。</p>\n<h3 id=\"囤积的检测口径\">囤积的检测口径</h3><p>按账号、按层位、按时间窗统计消耗量，与全体用户的分布做比较。关键在于用<strong>分布</strong>而不是固定阈值判断，因为不同系列的库存规模差异很大。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 单账号在 24 小时内对某层位的消耗，与整体分布对照&#10;WITH per_user AS (&#10;  SELECT owner_id, tier, COUNT(*) AS pulls&#10;  FROM unit_ledger&#10;  WHERE origin = &#39;pull&#39; AND acquired_at &gt;= now() - interval &#39;24 hours&#39;&#10;  GROUP BY owner_id, tier&#10;), ranked AS (&#10;  SELECT tier, pulls,&#10;         PERCENT_RANK() OVER (PARTITION BY tier ORDER BY pulls) AS pr&#10;  FROM per_user&#10;)&#10;SELECT tier, pulls, ROUND(pr::numeric, 4) AS percentile&#10;FROM ranked&#10;WHERE pr &gt;= 0.999&#10;ORDER BY pulls DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 单账号在 24 小时内对某层位的消耗，与整体分布对照</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> per_user </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> owner_id, tier, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pulls</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> unit_ledger</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> origin </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'pull'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> acquired_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interval </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'24 hours'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> owner_id, tier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), ranked </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tier, pulls,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         PERCENT_RANK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tier </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pulls) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pr</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> per_user</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tier, pulls, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(pr::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> percentile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ranked</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">999</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pulls </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>PERCENT_RANK() &gt;= 0.999</code> 的含义是&quot;落在该层位消耗量前 0.1% 的账号&quot;。这个口径比&quot;超过 N 次&quot;更稳健，因为它随库存规模自动缩放。返回结果进入人工复核队列，而不是自动限制。</p>\n<h3 id=\"囤积与自用的分界\">囤积与自用的分界</h3><p>大额抽取本身不违规——一个愿意为心仪款式投入的消费者完全可能抽上百次。真正需要区分的是<strong>抽取后是否流出</strong>。同一账号刚抽到的高价值款在极短时间内出现在二级市场上，是囤积转售的直接证据。这条判断需要把抽取台账与二级市场信号关联，具体做法见 <a href=\"resale-speculation-signal\">二级市场炒作信号</a>。此外，被囤积的层位会在库存上表现为消耗异常，其监控口径与告警阈值见 <a href=\"../probability-inventory/rare-item-stock-consistency\">稀有款库存与概率一致</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"防控措施的反作用\">防控措施的反作用</h2><p>每一项防控措施都有反作用，设计时必须一并考虑。</p>\n<h3 id=\"限流对正常峰值的影响\">限流对正常峰值的影响</h3><p>发售首日必然有真实的高峰。若限流规则按绝对频率设定，会把正常峰值也削掉。可行做法是按<strong>账号簇</strong>限流而非按全局频率限流，并对有过正常消费历史的账号给更高的容忍度。</p>\n<h3 id=\"验证码的成本\">验证码的成本</h3><p>加验能挡住大部分自动化，但同时会挡住一部分真实用户，尤其在中老年用户与网络条件差的地区。加验的触发应当尽量精准——只对已命中的嫌疑账号施加，不做全局验证码。</p>\n<h3 id=\"数据留存的边界\">数据留存的边界</h3><p>风控会收集设备指纹、地址、支付工具标识等敏感数据。这些数据只能用于风控决策本身，不得用于营销、不得跨用途共享、不得超期留存。簇关系与判定依据应有明确的保留期，到期删除聚合结果而不是原样长期保存。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>抢购者分自用、黄牛、投机三类，防控手段必须按误判代价不对称来分级。</li>\n<li>账号簇识别以地址与支付工具为主判据、设备指纹为辅证，簇规模本身不是封禁依据。</li>\n<li>自动化识别看两个信号：人类不可能的速度，以及人类不可能的节奏规律性。</li>\n<li>风控动作分观察、加验、限流、拒绝四级，默认从观察起步，仅簇+行为双重命中才直接限流。</li>\n<li>囤积检测用分位数口径而非固定阈值，并且必须与&quot;抽取后是否流出&quot;组合判断。</li>\n<li>风控收集的敏感数据仅可用于风控决策，簇关系须有保留期并到期删除。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"抢购/囤积炒作识别防控","id":"抢购-囤积炒作识别防控"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三类抢购者与他们的信号","id":"核心概念-三类抢购者与他们的信号"},{"level":2,"text":"身份聚合：把账号还原成实体","id":"身份聚合-把账号还原成实体"},{"level":3,"text":"聚合维度的选择与强度","id":"聚合维度的选择与强度"},{"level":3,"text":"簇识别的实现","id":"簇识别的实现"},{"level":2,"text":"抢购节奏与自动化识别","id":"抢购节奏与自动化识别"},{"level":3,"text":"秒级漏斗与人工边界的识别","id":"秒级漏斗与人工边界的识别"},{"level":3,"text":"风控动作的分级","id":"风控动作的分级"},{"level":2,"text":"囤积：库存侧的异常消耗","id":"囤积-库存侧的异常消耗"},{"level":3,"text":"囤积的检测口径","id":"囤积的检测口径"},{"level":3,"text":"囤积与自用的分界","id":"囤积与自用的分界"},{"level":2,"text":"防控措施的反作用","id":"防控措施的反作用"},{"level":3,"text":"限流对正常峰值的影响","id":"限流对正常峰值的影响"},{"level":3,"text":"验证码的成本","id":"验证码的成本"},{"level":3,"text":"数据留存的边界","id":"数据留存的边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"概率明示与价值披露要求","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/mystery-box-probability-commerce/probability-compliance/disclosure-odds-requirement"},"next":{"title":"二级市场炒作信号","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/mystery-box-probability-commerce/secondary-market-guard/resale-speculation-signal"}}